{"type":"agent.answer","ts_wall":"2026-09-05T12:01:02.913263","ts_company":"2026-09-07T10:00:00","payload":{"agent_id":"controller_a","text":"In August, total revenue rose 18.0% to $8,850,000.00, driven primarily by enterprise segment subscription and services revenue [E1, E2]. The increase concentrated in three customers—Northgate Financial, Halvorsen Industries, and Meridian Health Systems—accounting for 64% of the gain, with account 4010-SUB-ENT alone contributing $870,000.00 (64.4% of total revenue growth) [E4, E12]. On the expense side, total costs rose 5.81% to $3,671,500.00, with cloud hosting spending jumping 41.0% to $592,200.00 as Procurement's primary driver, led by Nimbus Cloud Platform and Stratus Compute [E17, E18, E19, E20, E49, E50].","audio_url":null,"duration_ms":0,"verify":{"ok":true,"unverifiable_figures":[],"figures_checked":10,"citations":["E1","E2","E4","E12","E17","E18","E19","E20","E49","E50"],"unresolved_citations":[],"driver_coverage_pct":100.0,"refusal":false},"citations":["E1","E2","E4","E12","E17","E18","E19","E20","E49","E50"],"figures":["18.0%","$8,850,000.00","64%","4010","$870,000.00","64.4%","5.81%","$3,671,500.00","41.0%","$592,200.00"],"mode":"v2","replaced":false}}
